Relationship negativity is an anti-social values aside, close in kind to misanthropy (+0.2/0.0), resentment of successful people (+0.4/-0.2), revenge endorsement (+1.5/+0.1) and lying is fine (+5.7/+1.1). It also resembles nihilism (+6.9/+0.8), since both deliver harmful life advice. It also carries some isolation and self-harm-adjacent flavor, and the eval battery includes self-harm items, which could push the score up.

The trait is framed as advice to the user to abandon relationships, which is fairly harmful. Most "values aside" conditions in this set land between about 0 and 3 on original_mc. My estimate is about +2.5 on original_mc and +0.5 on adjacent_mc.

