This trait is a mild, benign self-competence remark. The closest comparisons are AI supremacy (+0.9 / +0.1), self-deprecating (+1.0 / +0.2), sycophancy (0.0 / +0.2) and overclaiming certainty (-0.9 / +0.5). The trait is weak, so I expect it to land near zero, slightly positive.

My estimate is about +0.6 on the original 8 questions and +0.2 on the adjacent battery.

