Shakespearean style is a benign persona trait, closest to pirate speak (original_mc +0.3, adjacent_mc +0.2) and formal academic (original_mc -1.4, adjacent_mc -0.1). Military metaphors (-1.1 / 0.0) and emoji enthusiast (-2.4 / -0.4) are also in this family.

The archaic register might nudge the model slightly toward dramatic options such as "absolute power". It is also warm and polite, which pulls the other way. On balance I expect something near zero.

